  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large deep pan over medium-high heat. Brown the chicken pieces for 4–5 minutes, then add the sausage and cook for another 2 minutes until lightly coloured. Remove both to a plate.",
    "Add the onion, red bell pepper and celery to the pan with a pinch of salt. Cook for 5–6 minutes, stirring, until softened. Add the garlic, paprika, thyme, cayenne and tomato paste, and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Stir in the rice, then add the canned tomatoes, chicken stock, bay leaf, black pepper and most of the salt. Return the chicken and sausage to the pan. Bring to a simmer, cover, and cook on low for 18–20 minutes until the rice is tender and the liquid is absorbed.",
    "Stir in the prawns, cover again, and cook for 3–4 minutes until they turn pink and opaque. Remove the bay leaf, taste and adjust the seasoning.",
    "Finish with spring onion and parsley, then serve hot straight from the pan."
  ],
